POTCAR
WAVECAR
CHGCAR
CHG
DOSCAR
EIGENVAL
PROCAR
OSZICAR
XDATCAR
PCDAT
REPORT
IBZKPT
vasprun.xml
vaspout.h5
WAVEDER
TMPCAR
CONTCAR
std.out
std.err

